    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d33">

                <pb facs="0147" n="77" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg77"/>

                <head>No. 33.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Logan to Mr.
                    Frelinghuysen</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1882-10-26"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 26, 1882</date>.
                        (Received December 6.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 15.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Under cover of this dispatch I inclose the
                    copy of a note addressed by myself to the minister of foreign affairs, covering
                    in a brief and compact form the history of the recent peace negotiations with
                    Señor Garcia Calderon. My previous dispatches to you embrace the same subject in
                    a much more detailed and extended form.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>C. A. LOGAN.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d33-a1.xml" xpointer="d33-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
